  {
    "type": 0,
    "content": "ALL W1-6 MEALS SORTED INTO CATEGORIES AND SUB-CATEGORIES\nmade by Zuiq/GG on 9/1/2025\n(Some suggestions provided by: Chaos74, and a minor suggestion by occido, and [ ] )\n(Feel free to use or modify however you'd like)\n(Made this because I didn't see anything anywhere vaguely like this. meals are just sorted by a list of when their acquired) \n(Note:  (W6 Spice) means it needs a spice that is locked behind a W6 map/spirit lock before one can acquire the territory, this consists of the final 4 spices)\n(Note 2: I've abbreviated quite a few things  due to character limit and having less clutter; it should still be very understandable)\n(Note 3: meals in each sub-category are listed in order of when they are unlocked, not how strong their base%/% per level is) \n\n**COOK SPEED STUFF <<<**\n\n% MEAL COOK SPD\n``Egg +5% \nCorndog +12%\nSoda +20%\nDouble Cherry +30% \nBurned Marshmallow +40% (W6 Spice)\n\nCabbage +5% (+5% cook spd per 10 kitchen LV's)(& new recipe spd)`` \n\n% LOWER KITCHEN COSTS\n``Dango +2%\nDurian Fruit +6%\nRatatouey +8%``\n\n**COMBAT STUFF <<<**\n\n% GOLD FOOD BONUS\n``Yumi Peachring +2% (W6 Spice)``\n\n% BASIC ATK SPD\n``Cauliflower +1%``\n\n% TOTAL DMG\n``Turkey +2%\nOctoplop +2%\nOnion +3%\nMassive Fig +3%\nPlumpcakes +6% (W6 Spice)``\n\n% CASH FROM MONSTERS\n``Salad +3%\nBunt Cake +7%``\n\n% CRIT CHANCE\n``Mutton +1%``\n\n% TOTAL ACC\n``Cheesy Bread +1%``\n\n+BASE DEF\n``Apple +5``\n\n**SKILL EFF <<<**\n\n% SKILL EFF\n``Corn +2%\nRiceball +3%\nWhipped Cocoa +4%``\n\n``Leek +2% (% skill prow)`` (shares the same cap as the Skill prowess bubble, which is 2.00x)\n\n+x MAX LVs TP PETE TALENT \n``Buncha Banana +4``\n\n**SKILL MISC STUFF <<<**\n\n% LIQUID CAP\n``Pumpkin +2% (liquids 1 & 2)`` \n``Kiwi Fruit +2% (liquids 3 & 4)``\n\n% POINTS EARNED IN TD\n``Cannoli +1%``\n\n% CRITTERS FROM TRAPS\n``Sea Urchin +1%``\n\n% LIBRARY CHECKOUT SPD\n``Fortune Cookie +4%``\n\n% VIP LIBRARY\n``Garlic Bread +4%\nSourish Fish +4%\nOrange +3%\nSushi Roll +7%``\n\n% LOWER EGG INCUBATION TIME\n``Potato Pea Pastry +1%``\n\n% PET BREEDABILITY SPEED\n``Eggplant +5%``\n\n% PET FIGHT DMG\n``Croissant +1%\nWedding Cake +2%``\n\n% NEW PET ODDS\n``Frenk Fries +5%\nPizza +9%\nDonut +15%\nChocolate Truffle +25%``\n\n% RECIPE COOK SPD\n``Pie +5%\nCanopy +10%``\n\n+Px LINE WIDTH\n``Pancakes +2Px\nWild Boar +2Px``  (Wild Boar uneffected by ribbons?)\n\n``Eel +1% (Line Width %)``\n\n% BITS GAINED IN GAMING\n``Head Chef Bread +4%\nSausy Sausage +6%\n``\n% SAILING SPD\n``Popped Corn +2%``\n\n% CROP EVO CHANCE\n``Bill Jack Pepper +5% (W6 Spice)\nNyanborgir +9% (W6 Spice)``\n\n% SUMMON ESSENCE GAIN\n``Sticky Bun +5% (W6 Spice)``\n\n% JADE GAIN FROM SNEAK\n``Misterloin Steak +6% (W6 Spice)``\n\n**SKILL EXP STUFF <<<** \n\n% BREED EXP\n``Spaghetti +4%``\n\n% COOK EXP\n``Cheese +5%\nMashed Potato +6%``\n\n% LAB EXP\n``Garlicless Bread +2%\nSawdust +5%\nPretzel +7%``\n\n% DIVINITY EXP\n``Cotton Candy +2%\nWrath Grapes +4%``\n\n% GAMING EXP\n``Giant Tomato +5%``\n\n% FARM EXP \n``Seasoned Marrow +3% (W6 Spice)``\n\n% SUMMON EXP\n``Large Pohayoh +2% (W6 Spice)``\n\n% SNEAK EXP \n``Frazzleberry +2% (W6 Spice)``",
